const narrow = "ÇÐÞçþℂℍℕℙℚℝℤℎℏℊℋℌℐℑℒℓ℘ℛℜℬℰℱℳℭℨ";
for (let i = 0; i < narrow.length; i++) {
  const ch = narrow.charAt(i);
  defineSymbol(math, mathord, ch, ch);
  defineSymbol(text, textord, ch, ch);
}

